1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,167
Halfway. The thirteenth rule still
waits at the end. Don't skip it.

2
00:00:04,867 --> 00:00:07,800
Rule nine. Never turn off the camera
over aisle four.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,967
Camera four. Empty aisle. Nobody
there.

4
00:00:11,667 --> 00:00:15,867
A shadow crosses the shelf. Nobody
casts it. You keep stocking aisle one.

5
00:00:16,567 --> 00:00:19,833
Rule ten. Never stock aisle four after
two in the morning.

6
00:00:20,533 --> 00:00:25,067
2:15 AM. You stock aisle three. A can
rolls down aisle four by itself.

7
00:00:25,767 --> 00:00:27,867
Gravity. It's just gravity.

8
00:00:28,567 --> 00:00:33,267
The can stops at your feet. It's
labeled with today's date. The ink is
still wet.

9
00:00:33,967 --> 00:00:36,633
Okay. Nobody tell me what's in rule
seven.
